            "remove_text_wrapper": false,
            "heading": "<p class=\"mb-4 xl:mb-6\">As OSEA celebrates 30 years, we're reflecting on the journey that brought us here.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4 xl:mb-6\">Inspired by our great-grandmother Elsa's belief in the healing power of the ocean, Jenefer spent a decade developing seaweed-powered formulas before founding OSEA in 1996. What began as one family's vision has grown into a community of people who share our love for the sea.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4 xl:mb-6\">For three decades, we've remained family-oriented, guided by the same values that inspired OSEA from the beginning. As mother and daughter, it's a privilege to continue this work together and to carry our family's story forward.</p>",
            "heading_classes": "",
            "paragraph": "<div class=\"relative w-40 shrink-0\">\n<img alt=\"Elsa at the beach\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1368/9993/files/anniversary-2.jpg?v=1784154287\">\n<p class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 pr-2 text-sm text-white font-serif text-lg leading-tight\"><em>Elsa swimming in the snow, <br>Long Island, NY, <br>winter 1936</em></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"mb-4 xl:mb-6\">To everyone who has welcomed OSEA into your lives over the years, thank you. Your trust has made these first 30 years possible and we are so grateful to celebrate this milestone with you!</p>\n<p>Love,</p>\n<img alt=\"Jenefer &amp; Melissa\" class=\"w-48 mb-2 max-w-full\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1368/9993/files/jen_melissa_signature.png?v=1784153368\">\n<p>Mother &amp; Daughter Founders</p>\n</div>",
